@startuml User Journey
!theme plain
title User Journey - Complete HIL Testing Workflow
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

|Test Engineer|
start
:Login to Platform;

|Dashboard|
:View System Overview;
:Check Recent Test Results;
:Review System Health;

|Test Engineer|
:Decide to Run New Test;

|Project Management|
:Create/Select Project;
note right
    Project contains:
    - Camera configuration
    - Signal type (GPIO)
    - Test parameters
end note

|Video Management|
:Upload Test Video;
:Wait for Processing;
:Verify Video Quality;

|Ground Truth|
if (Ground Truth Exists?) then (yes)
    :Review Existing GT;
else (no)
    fork
        :Manual Annotation;
        note right
            Use annotation tools to
            mark VRU locations
            frame by frame
        end note
    fork again
        :ML Auto-Generation;
        note right
            Run YOLO detection
            to generate GT
        end note
    end fork
    :Validate Ground Truth;
endif

|Test Execution|
:Configure Test Session;
note right
    Parameters:
    - Latency threshold (ms)
    - Tolerance window
    - Enable precision timing
end note

:Verify LabJack Connection;
:Click "Start Test";

|System|
:Initialize Hardware;
:Start Video Playback;
:Monitor LabJack Signals;
:Record Detection Events;

|Test Execution|
:Watch Live Progress;
:View Real-time Detections;
:Monitor Signal Status;

|System|
:Video Completes;
:Stop Monitoring;
:Run Correlation Algorithm;
:Calculate Metrics;

|Results|
:View Results Dashboard;
partition "Analyze Results" {
    :Review Metrics Cards;
    note right
        - Precision: 94%
        - Recall: 92%
        - Mean Latency: 45ms
        - Pass Rate: 96%
    end note

    :Examine Frame Timeline;
    note right
        Visual correlation of:
        - Ground Truth frames
        - Detection events
        - Match status
    end note

    :Review Failed Detections;
    :Examine Failure Snapshots;
}

|Test Engineer|
if (Results Acceptable?) then (yes)
    :Approve Test Session;
    |Reports|
    :Generate PDF Report;
    :Download Results;
else (no)
    :Add Rejection Comments;
    :Flag for Re-test;
    |Test Engineer|
    :Investigate Issues;
    :Adjust Parameters;
    :Re-run Test;
endif

|Dashboard|
:Updated Statistics;
:Test History Recorded;

stop

legend right
    **Key Metrics Evaluated:**
    |= Metric |= Pass Criteria |
    | F1 Score | > 0.85 |
    | Mean Latency | < 100ms |
    | Max Latency | < 150ms |
    | Pass Rate | > 90% |
endlegend

@enduml
